5771-25/39031495_582094936911306_6800017255329826407_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wCrkoFw5sDUQ7kNvwFlpHvF&_nc_oc=AdpqJVx54novmNVuFyM2-XIiyyHA9R1PFR1qEVEMwkCHJfAG_AFRPl_X7bQivhsRDiE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTz4Js58qJ0C7Oe8KzW2nV-PrdBLwk3VD57Wlyc3VNP_A&oe=6B0DB4E3"}, "display_name": "Archery Land", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You became a warrior who was called by the goddess to protect the shrine of water. \nAs evening approaches, monsters aiming for the Shrine of Water appear.\n\nWarrior! \n\nPass 6 ordeals to protect the shrine of water from monsters.  And become a legendary warrior who protects the shrine of water and protects the goddess by killing monsters! \n\nAlso, Be the greatest warrior in a breathtaking 1v1 battle with other warriors in the arena of Archery Land.", "short_description": "Archery Land is a single, multiplayer VR shooting game, and Enjoy the thrilling feeling of hitting the target in our Archery Land by aiming the bow at the wide land.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover-MiniLandscape.png", "id": "1094889764444935", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974655_1094889767778268_3491009783949024005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=57zL_jUhnY4Q7kNvwHRxna6&_nc_oc=AdpP8pCAg6RXPppDibthh_jMVbEiTXHsW5wTn-47jnjeO4jS6XoaHIcqx0H8eKhV6fg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQQ3J1PTzPSGLIa4_KAFFEY9D7x3eiBqX00AMBRra8wIA&oe=6B0DB181"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1038643100096859", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974716_1038643103430192_688937563710773948_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JX-wHUVJGSoQ7kNvwGyVkVX&_nc_oc=AdqZCkvUc3RwW3L14Wtv2pbJq1ky9dpOJ9-KARDztOJNQxMsEJzkv1JGmUXdmLSrNrw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht